Equipment icons
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The trainer equipment window draws on two icon packs. Both are used under the
Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported License (CC BY 3.0):
- https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/

Only the subset that suits a Pokerole trainer is bundled; the picks are listed
in app-data/equip-icons-db.js and app-data/equip-icons-mono-db.js.

1. D&D Item Icons by Gwillewyn — the colour set
